<title>USA: Crown Andersen to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Crown Andersen to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>PEACHTREE CITY, Ga. 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Crown Andersen Inc said on Tuesday that its board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to $400,000 worth of its own common stock in the open market.</p>
<p>The company's shares have traded in the $6 a share to $7 a share range for the last four months, Crown Andersen said. The stock price is substantially below its book value, the company said.</p>
<p>Crown Andersen shares closed at 6-1/2, up 1/2, on 12,100 shares of volume.</p>
</text>
